:: Carter Hero Award Interlude Class [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Hart</span> is talking about classical literature and some of the old classic short stories you all will be reading and going over the next week or two. It isn’t as boring as some of his classes, since it seems the man was actually able to get some sleep the night before, but you still find it hard to pay attention. That is also due to the boy sitting next to you, <span style="Color: LightGreen"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>, who sways back and forth happily, a big smile on his face.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> seems to be doodling on a piece of paper, only half paying attention to the lecture. <br>
<br>
You glance over to see his drawing appears to be a picture of himself in a superhero costume and the words <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hero Award”</span> above it. Seems <span style="Color: LightGreen"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> is still giddy and excited about the award he’s getting this weekend. It’s rather adorable.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Kent</span>?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Hart</span> says, causing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> to jump and quickly turn his paper over, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Is everything alright? You are moving an awful lot in your seat. Did you need to use the restrooms?”</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Hart",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Smirk",
                    Eyes: "Tired",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "Carter",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Uniform",
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Blush: 2,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“N- no sir!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> replies with a flushed face, snapping back to reality as some around him chuckle. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alright then. Please try to sit still and pay attention.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Hart</span> gives him a confused look, but doesn’t seem to actually get upset since <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> is normally a very well-behaved kid. <span style="Color: LightGreen">But it seems even <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> can be a little distracted from excitement as he seems to struggle to avoid smiling as the class continues.</span> <br>
<<set $ActiveQuests.delete("Carter: Hero Award Class")>>
<br>
<<include"Attend English Finish">>

:: Carter Hero Award Interlude Dinner [nobr]

/* Intro */
As you sit down with your family to eat dinner, <span style="Color: Yellow">you can’t help but notice <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> smiling at you out of the corner of his eye and giving you a weird look.</span> You glance at him with a raised eyebrow and ask him why he’s looking at you like that. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Nothing. Just heard about what you’re doing this weekend.”</span> He replies with a smirk. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Dad",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Smirk",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What’s he doing this weekend?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> quickly asks, probably thinking you are going somewhere fun or exciting and wanting to join you. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Is he going to the boardwalk to ride the coaster!?”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Probably has a date with his boyfriend.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> teases. They all look at you, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> smiling and making it clear he isn’t going to tell them, so you explain that there is an award ceremony this weekend that you’ll be going to. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Noah",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Gabe",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                Eyes: "Mad",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$NoahNickname</span>’s getting an award?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> asks quizzically.
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No, he’s presenting one.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> corrects, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“To his friend <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>. He’s getting an award for his good deeds and asked your brother to be the one to present it to him. It’s so nice how quickly you’ve made such close friends.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sounds like boyfriends to me.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> jokes before being smacked by <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Ohhhh…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> nods, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That’s cool.”</span> They all continue eating and chatting, leaving the attention of them all no longer on you. <span style="Color: Yellow">It’s a little embarrassing to have everyone’s eyes on you, you half wonder why <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> wanted that so badly. You could do with your family’s eyes not all being on you at once.</span> <br>
<<set $ActiveQuests.delete("Carter: Hero Award Dinner")>>
<br>